{"t":"Ultimate Healing Rune","s":"ultimate-healing-rune-c1f28","k":"spell","i":"assets/wiki/Ultimate_Healing_Rune_c93429.gif","q":8,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p><i>This article is about the <b>Ultimate Healing Rune</b>. For the instant spell, see Ultimate Healing.</i></p><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Ultimate Healing Rune</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Ultimate Healing Rune\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"38\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ultimate_Healing_Rune_c93429.gif\" width=\"38\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Usage Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"words\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Words</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\">adura vita</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"mana\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Mana</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">400</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"subclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Group</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Support Spells\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Support_Cooldown_5c2691.png\" width=\"20\"/></span></span> Support (2 sec CD)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"cooldown\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Individual Cooldown</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2 seconds</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirement Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"voc\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Vocation</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Druid\">Druid</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"promotion\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Promotion</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"soul\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Soul Points</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"levelrequired\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">24</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"runegroup\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Rune Group</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Healing Runes</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unknown.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Spells <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-effect\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Effect\">Effect</span></h3>\n<p>Makes 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Ultimate%20Healing%20Rune%20%28Item%29\">Ultimate Healing Rune</a> (requiring 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Blank%20Rune\">Blank Rune</a>). Heal the target a large amount of HP. The amount changes with the magic level and level of the user.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<div class=\"webdesc\">\n<blockquote class=\"webdesc-text\"><p>The coveted Ultimate Healing rune is an all-time favourite among all vocations. No other healing enchantments that are bound into runes can compare to its salutary effect. For this reason the secret knowledge of how to create these precious runes is jealously guarded by the druids. Surely, particularly knights and paladins will rather use instant spells in critical situations, but once you are out of mana you are well advised to have a backpack of Ultimate Healing runes at hand.</p></blockquote>\n<div class=\"webdesc-from\" style=\"float: right; margin: 0 2em 0 0;\">—Tibia Library</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-spell-animation\"><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"scene_table canvas\" style=\"padding:32px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n<div class=\"effect\"></div>\n<div class=\"caster-east\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20171019130455&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mage_Outfit_Male_White_7e3ebc.gif\"/></div>\n<div class=\"effect\"></div>\n<div class=\"effect no_effect\"></div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Spells\">Related Spells</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Support_Spells\">Support Spells</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li>Animate Dead</li><li>Arrow Call</li><li>Aura of Exposed Weakness</li><li>Aura of Sapped Strength</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Avalanche\">Avalanche</a></li><li>Avatar of Balance</li><li>Avatar of Light</li><li>Avatar of Nature</li><li>Avatar of Steel</li><li>Avatar of Storm</li><li>Balanced Brawl</li><li>Blood Rage</li><li>Cancel Invisibility</li><li>Cancel Magic Shield</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Challenge\">Challenge</a></li><li>Chameleon</li><li>Charge</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Chivalrous%20Challenge\">Chivalrous Challenge</a></li><li>Conjure Arrow</li><li>Conjure Explosive Arrow</li><li>Conjure Wand of Darkness</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Convince%20Creature\">Convince Creature</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Creature%20Illusion\">Creature Illusion</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cure%20Poison%20Rune\">Cure Poison Rune</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Destroy%20Field\">Destroy Field</a></li><li>Disintegrate</li><li>Divine Dazzle</li><li>Divine Defiance</li><li>Divine Empowerment</li><li>Elemental Synthesis</li><li>Enchant Party</li><li>Enchant Spear</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Bomb\">Energy Bomb</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Field\">Energy Field</a></li><li>Energy Wall</li><li>Enlighten Party</li><li>Explosion</li><li>Find Fiend</li><li>Find Person</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Bomb\">Fire Bomb</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Field\">Fire Field</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Wall\">Fire Wall</a></li><li>Fireball</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Focus%20Harmony\">Focus Harmony</a></li><li>Focus Serenity</li><li>Food (Spell)</li><li><a href=\"#/w